Subject: Cantor Post Topology Scanner Formation Consistency Evidence Reconciliation Architecture Review

Description: Between-authority review after current scanner formation meaning is reconciled. It evaluates whether the next dependency should be direct Win32 traversal, physical fixtures, receipt issuance, or a pure bounded acquisition-lineage machine-form boundary. It selects source preservation for the pure boundary and leaves every operational M2C and M2D capability locked.

